  "accepted_outcomes": [
    "Hardware Direct2D/D3D11 final cursor rasterization on NVIDIA Quadro P620; normal GPU drawing has no completed CPU raster or final-canvas upload. CPU source glyph extraction and shared GDI layout measurement remain permitted work.",
    "Actual same-generation pre-Present GPU staging/readback after commit acknowledgement, seven independently decoded and visually inspected captures: original arrow with Unicode label and rounded A1 badge, ring with circular B2 badge, premultiplied custom glyph/halo, paused tint, native stock cross, Crosshair and IBeam.",
    "Production engine assertions cover movement without draw/present, two-surface cache bound/reuse, fully transparent application-hidden glyph, unpause restoration, lazy PRINT-only CPU replay, same-generation lazy GDI fallback on an owned injected cached-health failure, renderer detach/reinitialize, owned HWND style/no-activation/hotspot/capture-affinity and owner-thread destruction.",
    "Two virtual users in the real GUI worker report Auto/Direct2D. One authenticated scoped MCP settings mutation makes only user0 GDI. Real Ouroboros UI Auto/GDI/Auto Apply restores/reselects GPU while user1 remains Auto/Direct2D; final successful GPU draw counters are [3,1] and final CPU-canvas uploads [0,0].",
    "Real Stop click, virtual holds/known overlay absence and original worker handle exit0 are supported; authenticated client EOF/disconnect and ordinary GUI/target exits0 complete bounded cleanup without forced fallback. Descriptor retention until client EOF is intentional terminal-continuation behavior.",
    "Separate stopped-only12-control cohort observes user0 GDI draft with disabled Apply and saves the exact full captured profile with only user0.renderer changed to gdi, leaving user1 Auto. Its sole GUI exits0 with no target/Start/MCP/worker or forced cleanup."
  ],
